# 7x8-t1-001 + frame stones, SYMMETRIC TL train (the same a1 t b1 a2 b2 a3 on both edges), every event a
# variable: se = SE(-2,2)+SE(-2,1), bl = SU+(0,-2) level, bm = SU(1,-2), a* = SD(1,4) (a2 at (1,3)),
# t = SE(-1,3), b* = SD(1,5), r = SD(2,4), w = the SW(4,1)+SW(4,0) stack (one source at (4,2)).
